        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen awinjo gim'owinjere malo pa dwondi lwak ji madwoŋ ma polo munyo waco ni, “Paki Were! Both, dwoŋ kodi meni je apa Were mawan! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 32:43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.9.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kerin 9:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thumo banja pere otire kendo obedo mar'adieri! Kole go otieko thumo banja ri jatim giwickwot madwoŋ m'onwaŋo topo piny gi kidakana pere. Were omiyo go gir'acula rupiri go oneko jotic pere” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.34.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 34:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To odoko okoko ni, “Paki Were! Yiro ma wok i waŋ pere kidho malo cil gi cil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo, jodongo piero ario g'aŋwen no kodi cwec aŋwen no, je jogore piny to jolamo Were m'onwaŋo obedo wi kom pere ma dhum no, ka jowaco ni, “Ameno! Paki Were!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kalima ma nywomirok pa Nyathi rombo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
