            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo dwondi nyatoro owok i kom ma dhum ma waco ni, “Paki win Were mawan, win jotic pere je, gi ji je, jomadongo gi mathindho ma jolworo go!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.1.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze 1:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.93.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 93:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.97.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "97:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.99.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "99:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo awinjo gim'ocale dwondi Lwak madwoŋ, ma derino mere omor pa pi ma mol gi meni, kendo pa mwoc pa lithkoth madwoŋ. Awinjo ka jowaco ni, “Paki Were! Kole Rwoth Were mawan Majameni je dhumo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi wayodere wasangala; weyi wapaki dwoŋ pere m'oasere! Kole ndir otundo ma nywomirok maleŋ mapa Nyathi rombo, aka mweha pere otieko yikirok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omiy go ruko nanga mayom matar ma minyin.” (Nanga matar no meno tim m'otire mapa ji pa Were.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
