          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.22.2+MAT.22.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 22:2-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo malaika owaco ran ni, “Ndiki gime: Josilwany a jom'olwoŋ i kalima ma nywomirok pa Nyathi rombo.” Malaika no omedo waco ni, “Me obedo wac mar'adieri mapa Were.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo agore piny dho tiende ni alam go, to go owaco ran ni, “Ikir'itim ameno! A jatic nyawotin, acel kwoŋ wutmin in ma joridho adieri pa Yesu. Lami Were ayino! Kole adieri pa Yesu ama gudo cuny jatuci wac Were.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋata riemo kayina matar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
