        },
        {
          "text": "Biye win wicam delkwoŋ kerin, jotel ma lweny, kodi jomeni, riŋo kayina kodi joriemi mere, delkwoŋ ji je, ŋecin kodi joma ni siem, jomadongo kodi jomathindho!”",
          "type": "text",
