                  "text": "Meny 13:1-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To omako ogwaŋ no, kanyacel kodi jatuci wac Were ma twodo m'oyido jotimo gir'aura rigo. (Gir'aura no ama go owondo gine ji m'onwaŋo jonitie gi ranyuth p'ogwaŋ no to jolamo cal p'ogwaŋ no.) Ogwaŋ no kodi jotuci wac Were ma twodo je obol jo makwo i wakawaka ma mac kodi telin ma gamo mac mayot pa kibiriti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
